<http://www.spektrix.com/chesterplayhousenovascotia/event/37201ANNHRQCTNHTBVHBGGJGJCBQDGBJG>
  a schema:Event;
  schema:name "Cassie & Maggie";
  schema:description """
	<img src=\"https://system.spektrix.com/chesterplayhousenovascotia/files/a24e7895-3db2-4eab-8c96-edcd152f2391.jpg\" /><span><br/></span><h1>Cassie & Maggie</h1><span><br/></span>We are thrilled to welcome the harmonious duo Cassie & Maggie back to the Chester Playhouse for their first headlining show!<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>With more than 30 combined JUNO, Canadian Folk Music Award, East Coast Music Award and Music Nova Scotia Award wins and nominations, sisters Cassie and Maggie have become one of the most celebrated and dynamic acts in contemporary Canadian roots music.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Known for electrifying live performances, the Nova Scotia duo blends powerhouse fiddle, guitar, piano, close sibling harmonies, original songwriting and exhilarating percussive step dance into a show that moves effortlessly from driving tunes and soaring vocals to intimate songs and rich storytelling.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Their 2025 album, <span class=\"ItalicText\">Gold and Coal</span>, marked a major new chapter in their career, earning the duo their second JUNO nomination for Traditional Roots Album of the Year, alongside five Canadian Folk Music Award nominations, five East Coast Music Award nominations, and two Music Nova Scotia Award nominations for Folk/Roots Album of the Year and Entertainer of the Year. In 2026, they won the Canadian Folk Music Award for Ensemble of the Year and three ECMAs: Group of the Year, Roots Release of the Year and Traditional Release of the Year.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Dynamic, joyful and deeply rooted, Cassie & Maggie’s live show is a celebration of tradition, reinvention and the unmistakable chemistry of two sisters at the top of their game.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://youtu.be/rNsZxOKl1WY?si=2tD7wxPd73VQfZob/\">Discover Cassie &amp; Maggie!</a><span><br/></span><span><br/></span><span class=\"BoldText\">When</span> <span><br/></span>Saturday, May 8 at 7:30 pm<span><br/></span><span class=\"ItalicText\">2x45 minute sets, plus intermission</span><span><br/></span><span><br/></span><span class=\"BoldText\">Tickets</span><span><br/></span><span class=\"BoldText\">Adults</span> - <span class=\"BoldText\">$40.00</span>  ($37.37 + taxes & $3 Building Reserve Fee)<span><br/></span><span class=\"BoldText\">Youth (4-19)</span> - <span class=\"BoldText\">$20.00 </span> ($17.37 + taxes & $3 Building Reserve Fee) <span><br/></span><span class=\"BoldText\">$10 Community Tickets</span> use code <span class=\"BoldText\">10FOR10</span> (<span class=\"ItalicText\">limit of 10 per performance</span>)<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Reserved Seating<span><br/></span>Doors open 45mins before the show.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>The Chester Playhouse is wheelchair accessible. Please call the Box Office at (902) 275-3933 to arrange accessible seating.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Babes in arms & children under 4 are not permitted in the theatre.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span><span><br/></span>
""";
