<http://www.spektrix.com/chesterplayhousenovascotia/event/37401ACMVCJPTCNKQSKTHCVRCQVKKGRPH>
  a schema:Event;
  schema:name "Ian Stewart";
  schema:description """
	<img src=\"https://system.spektrix.com/chesterplayhousenovascotia/files/e21b3c45-65dd-4006-a08d-3fdc0c18b55e.jpg\" /><span><br/></span><h1>Ian Stewart - World Record Magician</h1><span><br/></span>Ian Stewart - World Record Magician returns to Chester with a brand new show promising an evening of magic, chain saws, mentalism, and incredible speed! <span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Ian Stewart is a standout when it comes to making unforgettable events. Using his distinctive mix of unique magic, mind-blowing mentalism, engaging audience participation and non-stop comedy, Ian creates experiences that linger in people’s minds long after the night is over!<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Prepare to witness the awe-inspiring magic that earned Ian the coveted world record for being the fastest magician of all time! Throw in a dash of juggling and a sprinkling of jaw-dropping stunts, and you have a proven recipe for unforgettable fun!<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Holding 24 World Records, and appearing on such legendary TV shows as <span class=\"ItalicText\">Late Show with David Letterman</span>, <span class=\"ItalicText\">the Tonight Show with Jay Leno</span>, <span class=\"ItalicText\">America's Got Talent</span>, <span class=\"ItalicText\">Penn & Teller’s Fool Us</span> and <span class=\"ItalicText\">Canada’s Got Talent</span>, Ian holds more world records than any other Canadian. He is a world class performer, based right here in Nova Scotia, that will entertain audiences of all ages.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Join us for a night of laughter and magic with Ian Stewart - World Record Magician!<span><br/></span><span><br/></span><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"http://www.worldrecordmagician.com/\">Discover Ian Stewart!</a><span><br/></span><span><br/></span><span class=\"BoldText\">When</span> <span><br/></span>Saturday, May 29 at 7:30 pm<span><br/></span><span class=\"ItalicText\">2x45 minute sets, plus intermission</span><span><br/></span><span><br/></span><span class=\"BoldText\">Tickets</span><span><br/></span><span class=\"BoldText\">Adults</span> - <span class=\"BoldText\">$32.00</span>  ($29.37 + taxes & $3 Building Reserve Fee)<span><br/></span><span class=\"BoldText\">Youth (4-19)</span> - <span class=\"BoldText\">$16.00 </span> ($13.37 + taxes & $3 Building Reserve Fee) <span><br/></span><span class=\"BoldText\">$10 Community Tickets</span> use code <span class=\"BoldText\">10FOR10</span> (<span class=\"ItalicText\">limit of 10 per performance</span>)<span><br/></span><span><br/></span><span class=\"BoldText\">Recommended for Ages 12+</span><span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Reserved Seating<span><br/></span>Doors open 45mins before the show.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>The Chester Playhouse is wheelchair accessible. Please call the Box Office at (902) 275-3933 to arrange accessible seating.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Babes in arms & children under 4 are not permitted in the theatre.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span><span><br/></span>
""";
