oin us as Matt Andersen brings the sound of the season to the Chester Playhouse stage with a collection of holiday favourites, sprinkled with a dusting of incredible original pieces.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://youtu.be/slvO9GqcSno/\">Discover Matt Andersen!</a><span><br/></span><span><br/></span><span class=\"BoldText\">When</span> <span><br/></span>Wednesday, December 2nd at 7:30 pm -<span class=\"BoldText\">SOLD OUT</span><span><br/></span>Thursday, December 3rd at 7:30  pm<span><br/></span><span class=\"ItalicText\">2x45 minute sets, plus intermission</span><span><br/></span><span><br/></span><span class=\"BoldText\">Tickets</span><span><br/></span><span class=\"BoldText\">Adults</span> - <span class=\"BoldText\">$65.00</span>  ($54.39 + taxes & $3 Building Reserve Fee)<span><br/></span><span class=\"BoldText\">Youth (4-19)</span> - <span class=\"BoldText\">$32.50 </span> ($25.88 + taxes & $3 Building Reserve Fee) <span><br/></span><span class=\"BoldText\">$10 Community Tickets</span> use code <span class=\"BoldText\">10FOR10</span> (<span class=\"ItalicText\">limit of 10 per performance</span>)<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Reserved Seating<span><br/></span>Doors open 45mins before the show.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>The Chester Playhouse is wheelchair accessible. Please call the Box Office at (902) 275-3933 to arrange accessible seating.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Babes in arms & children under 4 are not permitted in the theatre.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>
