	<img src=\"https://system.spektrix.com/chesterplayhousenovascotia/files/a3a99ec1-e5e1-4738-8941-88032cb0e0a5.jpg\" /><span><br/></span><h1>Steph Peaks & Friends</h1><span><br/></span>The incomparable <span class=\"BoldText\">Steph Peaks</span> returns to Chester with a veritable who’s who of fabulous queens for a night of incredible drag! <span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Beat the winter blues with glamour, glitz and guaranteed good time as Steph and her friends, Elle, Racheal, Mike, Betty, Saturn and Imarra bring jaw-dropping performances including lip-sync performances, gravity-defying stunts, and a night sure to celebrate the wide range of artistry and creativity of drag culture.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Whether you're a seasoned fan or a curious newcomer, join Steph Peaks and her talented cast of performers for an unforgettable celebration of self-expression, inclusivity, and the boundless magic of drag.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Steph’s previous performances in Chester sold out, so we encourage you to book your tickets for this high energy, playfully adult show soon, before they’re gone!<span><br/></span><span><br/></span><span class=\"BoldText\">When</span> <span><br/></span>Saturday, February 27 at 7:30 pm<span><br/></span><span class=\"ItalicText\">2x45 minute sets, plus intermission</span><span><br/></span><span><br/></span><span class=\"BoldText\">Tickets</span><span><br/></span><span class=\"BoldText\">Adults (19+)</span> - <span class=\"BoldText\">$35.00</span>  ($28.07 + taxes & $3 Building Reserve Fee)<span><br/></span><span class=\"BoldText\">$10 Community Tickets</span> use code <span class=\"BoldText\">10FOR10</span> (<span class=\"ItalicText\">limit of 10 per performance</span>)<span><br/></span><span><br/></span><span class=\"BoldText\">This show is 19+</span><span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Reserved Seating<span><br/></span>Doors open 45mins before the show.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>The Chester Playhouse is wheelchair accessible. Please call the Box Office at (902) 275-3933 to arrange accessible seating.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Babes in arms & children under 4 are not permitted in the theatre.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>
