  a schema:Event;
  schema:name "The Comic Strippers";
  schema:description """
	<img src=\"https://system.spektrix.com/chesterplayhousenovascotia/files/395837bf-47ae-4022-8e78-d5a38ca03a9a.jpg\" /><span><br/></span><h1>The Comic Strippers</h1><span><br/></span><h2>A Male Stripper Parody & Improv Show</h2><span><br/></span>Join us for <span class=\"ItalicText\">The Comic Strippers</span> — the hilarious male stripper parody and improv comedy show that’s guaranteed to bring the laughs! It’s cheeky, it’s outrageous, and it’s definitely <span class=\"ItalicText\">not</span> for the kids!<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>A fictitious male stripper troupe (played by a cast of some of Canada’s best, improvisational comedians) perform sexylarious improv comedy shows. They try to be sexy… it just comes out funny. Constantly grooving and gyrating in between scenes they banter with the crowd and perform their hilarious twist on improv sketches. They sing, they “dance”, and they are ready to make you laugh.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Semi undressed and completely unscripted, <span class=\"ItalicText\">The Comic Strippers</span> take off their shirts and take on your suggestions to create a whole new genre of comedy.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>“<span class=\"ItalicText\">The show is suitable for both men and women. An entertaining ride where anything goes</span>.” – Rip It Up Magazine <span><br/></span><span><br/></span>\"<span class=\"ItalicText\">One of the most hilarious shows I've ever seen</span>.\" - Vancouver Sun<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Suitable for all genders with only one WARNING! No extreme nudity, just extreme hilarity!<span><br/></span><span><br/></span><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://youtu.be/Ne_yFv7_WnA?si=wGMEJhYgjuLrou1V/\">Watch the Trailer!</a><span><br/></span><span><br/></span><span class=\"BoldText\">When</span> <span><br/></span>Saturday, June 12 at 7:30 pm<span><br/></span><span class=\"ItalicText\">2x45 minute sets, plus intermission</span><span><br/></span><span><br/></span><span class=\"BoldText\">Tickets</span><span><br/></span><span class=\"BoldText\">Adults (19+)</span> - <span class=\"BoldText\">$42.00</span>  ($39.37 + taxes & $3 Building Reserve Fee)<span><br/></span><span class=\"BoldText\">$10 Community Tickets</span> use code <span class=\"BoldText\">10FOR10</span> (<span class=\"ItalicText\">limit of 10 per performance</span>)<span><br/></span><span><br/></span><span class=\"BoldText\">The show is 19+</span><span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Reserved Seating<span><br/></span>Doors open 45mins before the show.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>The Chester Playhouse is wheelchair accessible. Please call the Box Office at (902) 275-3933 to arrange accessible seating.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Babes in arms & children under 4 are not permitted in the theatre.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span><span><br/></span>
""";
