<http://www.spektrix.com/chesterplayhousenovascotia/event/36601ATRPSQKSGHPQNCLQHVKLVNDQQCLK>
  a schema:Event;
  schema:name "Trent McClellan: Be Nice";
  schema:description """
	<img src=\"https://system.spektrix.com/chesterplayhousenovascotia/files/5f15d3e3-2f38-4c7b-b1c1-9c0b58a59455.jpg\" /><span><br/></span><h1>Trent McClellan</h1><h2>Be Nice</h2><span><br/></span>Chester, get ready to laugh until it hurts! We’re thrilled to welcome comedian and actor Trent McClellan to the Playhouse stage for a night of big laughs and unforgettable fun!<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Originally from Corner Brook, Newfoundland, Trent has earned a reputation as one of Canada's elite comedic talents of both stage and screen. A veteran standup, Trent has appeared on festivals across the country including Just For Laughs and Winnipeg Comedy Festival, and is the host of CBC's Halifax Comedy Festival. He is also a lead member of the recent Canadian Screen Award winning cast of <span class=\"ItalicText\">This Hour Has 22 Minutes</span>, and has appeared on numerous other programs including CBC's <span class=\"ItalicText\">The Debaters</span>. Trent effortlessly pulls audiences in with his charm and positive attitude, and his quick wit and hilarious delivery leave them in stitches.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>With new stories, sharp observations, and the signature warmth that has made him one of Canada’s most beloved comedians, Trent is sure to leave Chester in stitches. Join us in giving him a warm welcome!<span><br/></span><span><br/></span><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=vVPBE7lfPgc/\">Discover Trent McClellan!</a><span><br/></span><span><br/></span><span class=\"BoldText\">When</span> <span><br/></span>Saturday, March 27 at 7:30 pm<span><br/></span><span class=\"ItalicText\">75 minutes, no intermission</span><span><br/></span><span><br/></span><span class=\"BoldText\">Tickets</span><span><br/></span><span class=\"BoldText\">Adults (19+)</span> - <span class=\"BoldText\">$60.00</span>  ($57.37 + taxes & $3 Building Reserve Fee) <span><br/></span><span class=\"BoldText\">$10 Community Tickets</span> use code <span class=\"BoldText\">10FOR10</span> (<span class=\"ItalicText\">limit of 10 per performance</span>)<span><br/></span><span><br/></span><span class=\"BoldText\">This show is 19+</span><span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Reserved Seating<span><br/></span>Doors open 45mins before the show.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>The Chester Playhouse is wheelchair accessible. Please call the Box Office at (902) 275-3933 to arrange accessible seating.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Babes in arms & children under 4 are not permitted in the theatre.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span><span><br/></span>
""";
